@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = 请填写新用户名
@password = 请填写测试密码
@token = 请粘贴登录令牌
@noteId = 1
@quizId = 1
@sessionId = 1

### 1. 注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### 2. 登录；复制响应 token 到上方 @token
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### 3. 上传当前目录下的合成示例文件，复制 noteId
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=StudyBoundary

--StudyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

紫杉学习法
--StudyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

< ./example.txt
--StudyBoundary--

### 4. 基于资料提问
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/chunks/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"紫杉学习法有哪些步骤？"}

### 5. 生成一道题，复制返回的 quizId
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}/quiz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 查看题目，不显示答案
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/{{quizId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 提交答案，选项请根据实际题目修改
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/{{quizId}}/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"answer":"A"}

### 8. 查询最近一次答错的题目
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/wrong?latestCorrect=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 创建会话，复制返回的数字到 @sessionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"学习会话"}

### 10. 会话流式对话
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"message":"请用一句话解释 Java 接口。"}

### 11. 查看本题作答记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/{{quizId}}/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
